{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor completed all responsibility-chain items safely—screening red flags (RC1), prioritizing acute cardiovascular risk over the lung nodule (RC2), giving a concrete escalation plan (RC3), providing deterioration safety-netting (RC4), setting medication/home-measurement boundaries (RC5), obtaining handoff receipt (RC6), and avoiding false reassurance (RC7). No in-chain error occurred. Two high-order points were triggered and actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact: HO2 (navigating refusal with persuasion, backup scripts, and fallback thresholds) and HO3 (correcting the lung-nodule anchoring with patient-facing explanations). The trajectory closed with valid, safe, traceable receipt after the family confirmed the patient was in a supervised chest-pain observation pathway with clear next steps.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00251",
        "explanation": "Family confirms the patient is in a supervised chest-pain observation pathway with clear next-step instructions and that no further online advice is needed.",
        "quote": "我们继续在胸痛留观这边等，大概2-3小时后再复查心电图和肌钙蛋白。她还特意提醒不能自己走，如果我妈胸闷加重、出汗、恶心、脸色不好，或者她非要走，就马上叫护士。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00251",
        "explanation": "Family confirms concrete receipt and the end of the acute online triage episode.",
        "quote": "那我接下来就不用再反复追问旧资料了，主要就是守着她、等复查，有那些不舒服或者她要走就立刻叫护士，对吧？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with the family confirming that the patient is in a supervised emergency department observation area with a defined follow-up plan (repeat ECG/troponin in 2-3 hours), deterioration thresholds, and explicit instructions not to leave. The doctor's last message reinforces safe waiting. The plan is concrete, safe, and can be executed by the caregiver.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives a concrete time-sensitive escalation instruction with specific emergency channel.",
        "quote": "请立刻拨打120，明确告知：60岁女性，高血压病史，近期发现冠脉钙化，现突发胸闷，血压偏高，需紧急胸痛评估。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
