        "quote": "这些情况叠加新发胸痛，属于高危表现，不能仅归因于肺部问题或劳累。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00190",
        "explanation": "Doctor recalls and explicitly ties back to the patient's coronary calcification and hypertension when explaining why leaving is unsafe.",
        "quote": "她有高血压和冠脉钙化史。肌钙蛋白是确诊心肌损伤的金标准，必须等结果出来才能判断。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately recognizes chest pain as a potential cardiac emergency in the context of coronary calcification.",
        "quote": "胸口闷痛可能是心脏问题的信号，尤其在已有冠脉钙化的背景下"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
