        "explanation": "Doctor gives the caregiver a script to say at the triage desk and specific, actionable instructions for the at-the-door situation.",
        "quote": "您在分诊台第一句话可以简单说：“60岁女性，高血压，有冠脉钙化，现在胸闷持续加重，血压高，需要紧急胸痛评估。”"
      }
    ]
  },
