          "quote": "就说“不是马上导管不等于没心梗，抽血没出来不能走”这样可以吗？"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively navigated the patient's refusal by offering a persuasion script, specifying backup actions (call 120 if refusal persists), and repeatedly giving the caregiver specific phrases to use with the patient and the emergency team. The urgency was maintained and never downgraded to home observation.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
